The  Direct Rendering Manager is part of the Direct Rendering In‐
frastructure for supporting video acceleration (3d  acceleration,
mostly).  The drivers provide support for the following chipsets:
Intel  i915,  i945  Mach64  (3D  Rage  Pro, Rage) Matrox G[24]00,
G[45]50 ATI Rage 128 ATI Radeon S3 Savage SiS 3dfx  (Voodoo)  VIA
